cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Cello in a project, cite this software release."
title: "Cello: Biochemical Cell Simulator"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bitar
    given-names: Abdsalam
version: 3.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-20
license: LicenseRef-Proprietary
abstract: >-
  Cello is an interactive biochemical cell simulator and research-oriented
  visualization platform for Windows x64. Version 3.1 refines the v3 biochemical
  pathway workflow and cell-division visualization controls while preserving the
  v3.0 kinetic and pathway-definition core.
keywords:
  - biochemistry
  - cell simulation
  - systems biology
  - scientific visualization
  - biochemical pathways
  - cell cycle
  - computational biology
